    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> be the solution of the differential&nbsp;equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. If the area bounded by the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to ___ .",
    "image": null
